<meta seo title="Fault injection" description="Fault injection bench for component isolation: a component nested three levels deep fails on demand while the rest of the page keeps working." canonical="/">

<main class="page">
  <h1>Fault injection bench</h1>
  <p>The <a href="/lab">lab</a> makes a component three levels deep fail in its render, effect, derived value, handlers or resource. The <a href="/ssr">server render page</a> and the <a href="/pre">prerendered page</a> make it fail on the server.</p>
</main>

